        "description": "In the original series, Yuki is an assistant nurse to Dr. Sado, but she later also helps around the ship. \nRemake (2199): Ship Affairs Division Officer of Yamato.\n~!2202: Yamato‘s former ship’s affairs officer. She currently serves as chief navigator in the central control station of Earth Defense Headquarters. She lost her natural memory in an accident before she boarded Yamato, and now only has memories of the last four years.!~\n~!2205: Captain of the supply carrier Asuka (DAOE-01). Rank: Lieutenant Commander Second Class.!~\n~!3199: Former captain of the supply carrier Asuka (DAOE-01), currently a staff officer attached to the Earth Defense Force HQ. Rank: Lieutenant Commander Second Class.!~",
